    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Truck Up: Catch Me If You Can</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a post-apocalyptic world with <strong>Truck Up</strong>! Defend your towns from hordes of zombies with weapon-equipped vehicles, or control the undead army and unleash chaos upon cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two teams, two distinct strategies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defenders:</strong> Fight to protect the town using vehicles, drones, and heavy weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attackers:</strong> Take control of the zombies and transport deadly hordes into the city using buses, trucks, and drones!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Intense battles of strategy and chaos between two teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Mode:</strong> Stand your ground against waves of zombies in a defense war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer:</strong> Play offline with two players controlling two vehicles together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Realistic physics-based vehicle combat.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Destructible vehicles and unique weapon combinations.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>2 maps and 14 distinct vehicles offering diverse gameplay.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Controllable zombies, drones, and more!</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Coming Next?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding the number of maps: Mountains, deserts, islands, beaches, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding new vehicles and weapon types: Customize vehicles with unique weapon options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing new controllable devices: Mini remote-controlled vehicles alongside drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing zombie variety: New zombie species, including infected humans and animals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you defend the towns, or lead the zombie hordes to destruction? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Truck Up to your Steam Wishlist and join the action today!</strong></p>",
