, deserts, islands, beaches, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding new vehicles and weapon types: Customize vehicles with unique weapon options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing new controllable devices: Mini remote-controlled vehicles alongside drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing zombie variety: New zombie species, including infected humans and animals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you defend the towns, or lead the zombie hordes to destruction? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Truck Up to your Steam Wishlist and join the action today!</strong></p>",
